hako-base (0.2.11) trixie; urgency=medium

  * hako-dev: no systemd terminal reset (TTYReset=no, TTYVHangup=no) and
    RestartSec=2s for the ttyGS0 serial getty. The reset writes to the tty
    while holding the /dev/console lock; with no USB host the write blocked,
    and PID 1 hung on that lock the next time the game session stopped
    (after a monitor had taken over USB-C).

 -- hako-os <hako@hako-os>  Sat, 21 Nov 2026 20:00:00 +0900

