hako-base (0.2.3) trixie; urgency=medium

  * hako-dev: drop /etc/apt/sources.list.d/hako-dev.list. The PC repository
    (127.0.0.1:8780) is only reachable while scripts/dev-update.sh runs, and
    the permanent entry broke apt in the ELBE image build. dev-update.sh now
    adds the entry for the duration of its run.

