hako-base (0.2.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * hako-session and hako-dev, split from rpmini-bsp (were rpmini-session and
    rpmini-dev): user hako, /usr/lib/hako, /etc/default/hako-session, HAKO_*
    variables. Board defaults are read from /usr/lib/hako/session.d/*.sh.
  * The volume keys handler moved here (/usr/lib/hako/volume).
  * hako-dev depends on grim (screenshots of the session).

 -- hako-os <hako@hako-os>  Fri, 20 Nov 2026 20:00:00 +0900

